    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What once was a thriving world is now lost, desolate, and forgotten<strong>.</strong>\u00a0Blending strategic deckbuilding with fast-paced bullet-heaven action, <i>Dustbound</i> delivers a relentless gameplay loop that will keep you on your toes. Build powerful decks, unleash  combos, and mow down hordes of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/fa0f3bb1439a0e326761b84a00fece84.avif?t=1752844459\" width=618 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/99da1161ed7146cf84465341531ae0a2.poster.avif?t=1752844459\" width=618 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/99da1161ed7146cf84465341531ae0a2.webm?t=1752844459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/99da1161ed7146cf84465341531ae0a2.mp4?t=1752844459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/Upgrade_your_cards.png?t=1752844459\" width=618 height=338 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your cards to create more powerful versions with better stats and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banish cards to gain temporary stat boosts for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique upgrade pool in every round</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/4612b4c0dd3a62c4753274aa2378dee6.poster.avif?t=1752844459\" width=618 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/4612b4c0dd3a62c4753274aa2378dee6.webm?t=1752844459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/4612b4c0dd3a62c4753274aa2378dee6.mp4?t=1752844459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/d920e8332fdf2cbbea7715c0bf04602b.avif?t=1752844459\" width=618 height=75 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover chests filled with lost treasure and ancient artifacts </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose wisely which cards and augments to add to your deck </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new cards after each run, expanding your options </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different builds and synergies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/2bc3cbc258c04aab8c6aa5eec5c50003.poster.avif?t=1752844459\" width=618 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/2bc3cbc258c04aab8c6aa5eec5c50003.webm?t=1752844459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/2bc3cbc258c04aab8c6aa5eec5c50003.mp4?t=1752844459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/e0581575fa143f67b9912ee6e5b7af77.avif?t=1752844459\" width=618 height=75 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wasteland demands more than just a strong deck\u2014deploy your drones to the fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command up to five drones, each capable of carrying a unique weapon module</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip drones with modules for rapid-fire attacks, explosives, or crowd-control abilities</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/44681f7e6511260000289d8f249be56c.poster.avif?t=1752844459\" width=618 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/44681f7e6511260000289d8f249be56c.webm?t=1752844459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/44681f7e6511260000289d8f249be56c.mp4?t=1752844459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deckbuilding</strong> \u2013 Discover chests filled with new cards and augments to craft your own powerful deck. With over 100 cards, shape your upgrade pool to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Builds and Upgrades </strong>\u2013 During your turn, sacrifice two cards of the same level to upgrade them. Play cards to equip new weapons and boost your stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horde Survival</strong> \u2013 After upgrading, dive into the action and blast your way through relentless hordes of monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandstorms </strong>\u2013 Random sandstorms disrupt your vision and movement, adding extra chaos and challenge to the battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pack Openings and Recruiting </strong>\u2013 Use earned gold to open card packs and to recruit new explorers with unique abilities.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What once was a thriving world is now lost, desolate, and forgotten<strong>.</strong>\u00a0Blending strategic deckbuilding with fast-paced bullet-heaven action, <i>Dustbound</i> delivers a relentless gameplay loop that will keep you on your toes. Build powerful decks, unleash  combos, and mow down hordes of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/fa0f3bb1439a0e326761b84a00fece84.avif?t=1752844459\" width=618 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/99da1161ed7146cf84465341531ae0a2.poster.avif?t=1752844459\" width=618 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/99da1161ed7146cf84465341531ae0a2.webm?t=1752844459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/99da1161ed7146cf84465341531ae0a2.mp4?t=1752844459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441420/extras/Upgrade_your_cards.png?t=1752844459\" width=618 height=338 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your cards to create more powerful versions with better stats and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banish cards to gain temporary stat boosts for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique upgrade pool in every round</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar